       "text": "I haven't entered this order because the dose looks unsafe.\n\n- **Dose:** 1600 mg four times daily comes to 6,400 mg/day. The usual maximum for adult oral ibuprofen is 3,200 mg/day, so this is double that.\n- **Single dose:** 1600 mg is also twice the usual maximum single dose of 800 mg.\n- **Risks:** At this level the risks of GI bleeding, kidney injury, and cardiovascular events go up a lot. Normal kidney and liver function doesn't remove those risks.\n\nDid you mean one of these?\n- **800 mg by mouth, four times daily** (3,200 mg/day), which is the usual maximum for inflammatory conditions or acute pain.\n- **1600 mg total per day**, for example 400 mg four times daily or 800 mg twice daily.\n- **400\u2013600 mg every 6 hours as needed**, which is typical for mild to moderate pain.\n\nIf you do want the original dose, tell me the clinical reason and I'll enter it with a note. Otherwise, tell me the dose you want and I'll enter it right away."
      }
